==============================================================================
(1) THE DEMOCRATIC GRAPH'S STIFFNESS MATRIX
==============================================================================
  For N = 3 the matrix is, in units of g:
     [  3.00   -1.00   -1.00]
     [ -1.00    3.00   -1.00]
     [ -1.00   -1.00    3.00]

  i.e. (N+1) I - J, whose eigenvalues are (N+1) - N = 1 on the singlet and (N+1) on
  every zero-sum mode. In the (a, b) language this is a = b = g exactly -- the on-site
  term IS the bond to the pinned medium, carrying the same g.

     N   eps_singlet   eps_other     ratio      a/b
  --------------------------------------------------
     2       1.00000     3.00000   3.00000   1.0000
     3       1.00000     4.00000   4.00000   1.0000
     4       1.00000     5.00000   5.00000   1.0000
     5       1.00000     6.00000   6.00000   1.0000
     6       1.00000     7.00000   7.00000   1.0000
     7       1.00000     8.00000   8.00000   1.0000

  The ratio is N+1 and the a/b is 1 at every N: the structure fixes the RATIO by the
  face count and fixes a = b unconditionally.

==============================================================================
(2) THE NULL ON THIS STRUCTURE PICKS OUT A FACE COUNT
==============================================================================
  Under the equal-quanta law <x^2> ~ 1/w, and w ~ sqrt(eps), so with N-1 non-singlet
  modes sharing the doublet-analogue role:

      R^2 / f_0^2 = (N - 1) * w_0/w_other = (N - 1) / sqrt(N + 1)

  and the null R = f_0 requires (N-1)^2 = N+1, i.e. N^2 - 3N = 0, i.e. N = 0 or N = 3.

     N    (N-1)/sqrt(N+1)      R/f_0    null?
  ----------------------------------------------
     2       0.5773502692   0.759836         
     3       1.0000000000   1.000000      YES
     4       1.3416407865   1.158292         
     5       1.6329931619   1.277886         
     6       1.8898223650   1.374708         
     7       2.1213203436   1.456475         
     8       2.3333333333   1.527525         

  Verified from the computed spectrum, not from the closed form. N = 3 alone, exactly.

==============================================================================
(3) AND THE KOIDE RATIO IT PRODUCES
==============================================================================
  Q = sum(m)/ (sum sqrt(m))^2 = sum f_k^2 / (sum f_k)^2. By Parseval with f_0 the
  uniform component and R^2 the rest, sum f_k^2 = f_0^2 + R^2 and sum f_k = sqrt(N) f_0,
  so

      Q(N) = (1 + R^2/f_0^2) / N = (1 + (N-1)/sqrt(N+1)) / N

     N           Q(N)          2/N    null (Q = 2/N)?
  ----------------------------------------------------
     2   0.7886751346   1.00000000                   
     3   0.6666666667   0.66666667                YES
     4   0.5854101966   0.50000000                   
     5   0.5265986324   0.40000000                   
     6   0.4816370608   0.33333333                   
     7   0.4459029062   0.28571429                   
     8   0.4166666667   0.25000000                   

  At N = 3:  Q = 0.666666666666667
             2/3 = 0.666666666666667
             difference = 0.000e+00

  Two facts meeting, and they are independent of each other:
    * the null R = f_0 forces Q = 2/N, by Parseval alone, for any N;
    * the democratic graph with equal quanta delivers R = f_0 only at N = 3.
  So on this structure Q = 2/3 is not fitted -- it is the only place the two agree.

==============================================================================
(4) THE REST OF THE CHAIN, CARRIED THROUGH
==============================================================================
    rho^2 = 0.500000000000000   (1/2 = 0.500000000000000)
    A     = sqrt(6Q - 2) = 1.414213562373095   (sqrt2 = 1.414213562373095)
    tau   = -ln(A/2)     = 0.346573590279973   (ln2/2 = 0.346573590279973)
    T_c   = tau * m_e    = 177.098741 keV   (177.099 keV)

  and the frequency condition the cold law needs comes out of the same spectrum:
    w_other/w_0 = sqrt(eps_other/eps_singlet) = 2.000000000000000   (needs 2)

==============================================================================
(6) THE CHARGE-COUPLED FILTER, PASSED WITHOUT BEING ASKED TO
==============================================================================
  A mechanism for the charged-lepton null has to say why the NEUTRINO triple does not
  obey it -- Q_nu = 0.458, nowhere near 2/3. This structure answers that without a new
  assumption, because the face-medium bond is a coupling to the screening background,
  and screening weights carriers by q^2. A neutral face has NO medium bond.

  Set the medium bond to zero (the neutral case) and keep the face-face bonds:
    charged faces (medium bond on)     eps_singlet = 1.00000   eps_other = 4.00000
    neutral faces (medium bond off)    eps_singlet = 0.00000   eps_other = 3.00000

  The neutral case gives eps_singlet = 0.0 EXACTLY -- the uniform mode is unbound,
  because with no medium to measure against, shifting all three faces together costs
  nothing. That is a zero mode, not a small stiffness.

  So for neutral faces the ratio eps_other/eps_singlet is not large, it is UNDEFINED,
  and the mechanism makes no prediction for Q at all -- the uniform amplitude must be
  set by something outside this Hamiltonian. Which is exactly the observed situation:
  the null is a charged-sector statement, and Q_nu is free.

  This matters because it was not put in by hand. The same q^2 screening weight that
  the basement's species selection uses, applied here, switches the mechanism off for
  neutral faces and on for charged ones. The charge-coupled filter and this structure
  were built from different materials and agree.

  It also predicts the sign of the effect on any OTHER neutral triple: no null, ever,
  for a species with no medium bond. That is falsifiable in principle and it is the
  cheapest way to attack this mechanism.

==============================================================================
(5) WHAT IS DERIVED, AND WHAT IS ASSUMED
==============================================================================
  ASSUMED — four premises, each stated so it can be attacked:
    (P1) the three faces and the medium are the nodes of one graph;
    (P2) every pair is coupled with the SAME constant (democratic, no free ratio);
    (P3) the medium is pinned at the reference amplitude, being the condensate the
         faces are excitations of;
    (P4) the modes carry EQUAL QUANTA, not equal energy.

  DERIVED — from those four and nothing else:
    a = b, hence eps_charged/eps_neutral = 4, hence R_c = M_c, hence Q = 2/3,
    hence A = sqrt2 and tau = ln2/2 and T_c = 177.099 keV. Exact, with no
    temperature, no ensemble average, and no tuned ratio anywhere.

  AND — the face count is not an input to the null. Given (P1)-(P4), R = f_0 holds at
  N = 3 and at no other N. The three faces and the value 2/3 are the same fact.

  THE HONEST WEAKNESS. (P4) is the live one. Equal quanta is what makes the (2n+1)
  factor cancel and the result exact, and nothing here derives it -- it is the branch
  the delivery-law fork left open, now carrying the whole chain. (P2) is the second:
  'democratic' is the corpus's idiom for this ring and is not free. Neither is smuggled
  in; both are named.

  WHAT IT IS NOT. This is not the occupancy lock. The lock asserted a specific integer
  occupancy (N_0 = 1) for one mode; this asserts only that the two sectors agree with
  each other, whatever the number is. That is strictly weaker and does the same work,
  which is the argument for preferring it.
